@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = paste-access-token-here
# The personal access client is created by PassportClientSeeder (php artisan migrate:fresh --seed); no manual passport:client step.

### SYS-01 Ping (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping
Accept: application/json

### SYS-02 Ping auth (any logged-in user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping/auth
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
